#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:240
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:761
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Code is being produced faster and at greater volume than ever. Tuist plugs into the build systems you already use, on Xcode, Gradle, Bazel, Elixir, Rust, and Struo projects, providing the infrastructure that lets software integration and delivery keep pace."
msgstr "代碼嘅產出速度同規模都達到前所未有嘅水平。Tuist 可以整合到你已經使用嘅構建系統，支援 Xcode、Gradle、Bazel、Elixir、Rust 同 Struo 項目，提供所需基礎設施，讓軟件集成同交付跟上節奏。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:371
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:784
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Share Xcode, Gradle, Bazel, Rust, and Struo build artifacts and audited Elixir dependency bundles across machines and CI. Rust caching is experimental."
msgstr "喺唔同機器同 CI 之間共享 Xcode、Gradle、Bazel、Rust 同 Struo 嘅構建成品，以及經過審核嘅 Elixir 依賴套件。Rust 快取功能目前處於實驗階段。"